{"head":[["What's wrong, Tom?","My head hurts.","톰, 무슨 일이야? / 머리가 아파."],["Where is your hat?","It is on my head.","모자 어디 있어? / 내 머리 위에 있어."]],"ear":[["Can you hear me?","Yes, put it near my ear.","내 말 들려? / 응, 내 귀 가까이 대 줘."],["Why are you touching your ear?","It feels cold.","왜 귀를 만져? / 차가운 느낌이 들어."]],"mouth":[["Open your mouth, please.","Ahhh! Like this?","입을 벌려 주세요. / 아~ 이렇게요?"],["Don't talk with food in your mouth.","Sorry, Mom.","입에 음식을 넣고 말하지 마. / 죄송해요, 엄마."]],"arm":[["Why can't you play?","I hurt my arm.","왜 못 놀아? / 팔을 다쳤어."],["Raise your right arm.","Like this, teacher?","오른팔을 들어 보세요. / 이렇게요, 선생님?"]],"leg":[["Can you kick the ball?","Yes, with my left leg!","공을 찰 수 있어? / 응, 왼쪽 다리로!"],["A spider has eight legs. How about a dog?","A dog has four. Each leg is short.","거미는 다리가 여덟 개야. 개는? / 개는 네 개야. 다리가 각각 짧아."]],"eye":[["Is something in your eye?","Yes, a little sand.","눈에 뭐가 들어갔어? / 응, 모래가 조금."],["Close one eye and look.","I can see the bird!","한쪽 눈을 감고 봐. / 새가 보여!"]],"nose":[["Why are you sneezing?","My nose is itchy.","왜 재채기해? / 코가 간지러워."],["Can you smell the cake?","Yes! My nose knows.","케이크 냄새 나? / 응! 내 코는 다 알아."]],"tooth":[["Why are you crying?","My tooth hurts.","왜 울어? / 이가 아파."],["Look! My tooth fell out.","Wow, you are growing up!","봐! 내 이가 빠졌어. / 와, 너 크고 있구나!"]],"hand":[["Wash your hands before lunch.","Okay, I will wash my hand now.","점심 전에 손 씻어라. / 네, 지금 손 씻을게요."],["Can I hold your hand?","Sure, let's walk together.","네 손 잡아도 돼? / 물론, 같이 걷자."]],"foot":[["How do you go to school?","I go on foot.","학교에 어떻게 가? / 걸어서 가."],["Ouch! You stepped on my foot.","Oh, I'm sorry!","아야! 네가 내 발을 밟았어. / 아, 미안해!"]],"face":[["Your face is red.","I ran very fast.","얼굴이 빨개. / 아주 빨리 뛰었어."],["Wash your face, Amy.","Okay, Dad.","에이미, 세수해. / 네, 아빠."]],"body":[["What do we wash in the bath?","We wash our body.","목욕할 때 무엇을 씻어? / 우리 몸을 씻어."],["Let's move our body!","One, two, jump!","몸을 움직여 보자! / 하나, 둘, 점프!"]],"hair":[["Your hair is so long!","My mom brushes it.","네 머리카락 정말 길다! / 엄마가 빗겨 줘."],["Is your hair wet?","Yes, I just took a bath.","머리카락 젖었어? / 응, 방금 목욕했어."]],"chin":[["Where is the soup?","It's on your chin!","수프가 어디 있어? / 네 턱에 묻었어!"],["Why are you holding your chin?","I'm thinking.","왜 턱을 괴고 있어? / 생각하는 중이야."]],"lip":[["Why is your lip red?","I ate a red candy.","입술이 왜 빨개? / 빨간 사탕을 먹었어."],["Ouch, I bit my lip.","Are you okay?","아야, 입술을 깨물었어. / 괜찮아?"]],"neck":[["It's cold today.","Put a scarf around your neck.","오늘 추워. / 목에 목도리를 둘러."],["A giraffe is so tall!","Yes, it has a long neck.","기린은 정말 키가 커! / 응, 목이 길어."]],"back":[["Where is your bag?","It's on my back.","가방 어디 있어? / 내 등에 있어."],["Come back soon!","I will, Grandma.","곧 다시 와! / 그럴게요, 할머니."]],"knee":[["Why are you sitting down?","I hurt my knee.","왜 앉아 있어? / 무릎을 다쳤어."],["Bend your knee and jump.","Like a frog!","무릎을 굽히고 뛰어. / 개구리처럼!"]],"toe":[["Why are you jumping?","I hit my toe on the door.","왜 깡충거려? / 문에 발가락을 부딪혔어."],["Can you touch your toe?","Yes, look at me!","발가락에 손이 닿아? / 응, 나 봐!"]],"finger":[["What is on your nose?","My finger! Ha ha.","코에 뭐가 있어? / 내 손가락! 하하."],["What is on your finger?","It's a small ring.","손가락에 뭐가 있어? / 작은 반지야."]],"family":[["Who is in this picture?","It's my family.","이 사진에 누가 있어? / 우리 가족이야."],["How many people are in your family?","Four people.","가족이 몇 명이야? / 네 명이야."]],"father":[["Who is that tall man?","He is my father.","저 키 큰 남자는 누구야? / 우리 아버지야."],["My father cooks on Sunday.","Wow, that's nice!","우리 아빠는 일요일에 요리해. / 와, 멋지다!"]],"mother":[["Who made this cake?","My mother made it.","이 케이크 누가 만들었어? / 우리 엄마가 만들었어."],["Where is your mother?","She is in the kitchen.","엄마 어디 계셔? / 부엌에 계셔."]],"aunt":[["Who is coming today?","My aunt is coming.","오늘 누가 와? / 이모가 와."],["This is my mom's sister.","Oh, she is your aunt!","이분은 우리 엄마의 언니야. / 아, 네 이모구나!"]],"grandmother":[["Who knits your scarf?","My grandmother does.","목도리는 누가 떠 줘? / 우리 할머니가 떠 주셔."],["Where does your grandmother live?","She lives in the country.","할머니는 어디 사셔? / 시골에 사셔."]],"brother":[["Do you have a brother?","Yes, he is ten.","남자 형제 있어? / 응, 열 살이야."],["Who is that boy?","That's my little brother.","저 남자아이는 누구야? / 내 남동생이야."]],"sister":[["Who is that girl?","She is my sister.","저 여자아이는 누구야? / 내 언니야."],["My sister likes to dance.","Mine likes to sing.","우리 언니는 춤추는 걸 좋아해. / 우리 언니는 노래를 좋아해."]],"baby":[["Shh! Be quiet.","The baby is sleeping.","쉿! 조용히 해. / 아기가 자고 있어."],["Why is the baby crying?","Maybe she is hungry.","아기가 왜 울어? / 배고픈가 봐."]],"grandfather":[["Who is the man with white hair?","He is my grandfather.","흰머리 할아버지는 누구야? / 우리 할아버지야."],["My grandfather tells funny stories.","I love his stories!","우리 할아버지는 재미있는 이야기를 해 주셔. / 나 그 이야기 좋아!"]],"uncle":[["Who gave you this toy?","My uncle did.","이 장난감 누가 줬어? / 삼촌이 줬어."],["Is that your dad's brother?","Yes, he is my uncle.","저분이 너희 아빠 형제야? / 응, 우리 삼촌이야."]],"cousin":[["Who is your best friend?","My cousin, Mina.","가장 친한 친구가 누구야? / 내 사촌 미나야."],["Is Ben your brother?","No, he is my cousin.","벤이 네 형이야? / 아니, 내 사촌이야."]],"child":[["Is this movie for adults?","No, it's for a child.","이 영화는 어른용이야? / 아니, 어린이용이야."],["Who is that child?","That's my little sister.","저 아이는 누구야? / 내 여동생이야."]],"job":[["What is your mom's job?","She is a nurse.","엄마 직업이 뭐야? / 간호사야."],["Do you like your job?","Yes, I love teaching!","일이 좋으세요? / 네, 가르치는 게 정말 좋아요!"]],"artist":[["Who painted this picture?","A famous artist did.","이 그림 누가 그렸어? / 유명한 예술가가 그렸어."],["I want to be an artist.","You draw very well!","나는 예술가가 되고 싶어. / 너 그림 정말 잘 그려!"]],"cook":[["What is your dad's job?","He is a cook.","아빠 직업이 뭐야? / 요리사야."],["Who will make dinner tonight?","I will cook pasta!","오늘 저녁은 누가 만들어? / 내가 파스타를 요리할게!"]],"farmer":[["Who grows these apples?","A farmer grows them.","이 사과는 누가 길러? / 농부가 길러."],["The farmer has many cows.","Can we see them?","그 농부는 소가 많아. / 우리 봐도 돼?"]],"dancer":[["She moves so well!","She is a dancer.","그녀는 정말 잘 움직여! / 무용수야."],["What do you want to be?","I want to be a dancer.","뭐가 되고 싶어? / 무용수가 되고 싶어."]],"doctor":[["I have a fever.","Let's go see a doctor.","열이 나. / 의사 선생님께 가 보자."],["Who works at the hospital?","A doctor works there.","병원에서 누가 일해? / 의사가 거기서 일해."]],"nurse":[["Who helped you at the hospital?","A kind nurse helped me.","병원에서 누가 도와줬어? / 친절한 간호사가 도와줬어."],["What does a nurse do?","She takes care of sick people.","간호사는 무슨 일을 해? / 아픈 사람들을 돌봐."]],"singer":[["Who is singing on TV?","She is my favorite singer.","TV에서 누가 노래해? / 내가 제일 좋아하는 가수야."],["You sing so well!","I want to be a singer.","너 노래 정말 잘한다! / 나는 가수가 되고 싶어."]],"sad":[["Why are you sad?","I lost my dog.","왜 슬퍼? / 강아지를 잃어버렸어."],["The movie made me cry.","Was it sad?","영화 보고 울었어. / 슬펐어?"]],"happy":[["You look happy today!","It's my birthday!","오늘 행복해 보여! / 내 생일이거든!"],["How do you feel?","I feel happy.","기분 어때? / 행복해."]],"angry":[["Why is Mom angry?","I broke her cup.","엄마가 왜 화나셨어? / 내가 엄마 컵을 깼어."],["Don't be angry, please.","Okay, I'm sorry too.","화내지 마. / 알았어, 나도 미안해."]],"smile":[["Look at the camera!","Okay, I will smile.","카메라 봐! / 응, 웃을게."],["Your smile is so pretty.","Thank you!","네 미소 정말 예쁘다. / 고마워!"]],"cry":[["Why do babies cry?","They are hungry or sleepy.","아기들은 왜 울어? / 배고프거나 졸려서야."],["Don't cry. I'm here.","Thank you, Mom.","울지 마. 내가 있잖아. / 고마워요, 엄마."]],"sick":[["Why didn't you come to school?","I was sick.","왜 학교에 안 왔어? / 아팠어."],["I feel sick.","Go and see a doctor.","몸이 안 좋아. / 병원에 가 봐."]],"old":[["Is your dog a puppy?","No, he is very old.","너희 개는 강아지야? / 아니, 아주 나이가 많아."],["Is this a new bike?","No, it's an old one.","이거 새 자전거야? / 아니, 낡은 거야."]],"young":[["Can your sister read?","No, she is too young.","여동생은 글을 읽을 수 있어? / 아니, 너무 어려."],["Is your teacher old?","No, she is young.","선생님은 나이가 많아? / 아니, 젊으셔."]],"hungry":[["I'm so hungry.","Let's eat lunch!","나 너무 배고파. / 점심 먹자!"],["Is the cat hungry?","Yes, give it some fish.","고양이 배고파? / 응, 생선 좀 줘."]],"full":[["Do you want more rice?","No, thanks. I'm full.","밥 더 먹을래? / 아니, 괜찮아. 배불러."],["Is the box empty?","No, it's full of toys.","상자가 비었어? / 아니, 장난감으로 가득 찼어."]],"fast":[["A cheetah can run fast.","Faster than a car?","치타는 빨리 달릴 수 있어. / 차보다 더?"],["Don't eat so fast!","Sorry, I'm hungry.","그렇게 빨리 먹지 마! / 미안, 배고파서."]],"slow":[["Is a turtle fast?","No, it is slow.","거북이는 빨라? / 아니, 느려."],["Can you walk slow?","Okay, I will wait for you.","천천히 걸어 줄래? / 응, 너를 기다릴게."]],"big":[["Look at the elephant!","It's so big!","코끼리 좀 봐! / 정말 커!"],["Is your house big?","No, it's small.","너희 집 커? / 아니, 작아."]],"small":[["Is the mouse big?","No, it is small.","쥐는 커? / 아니, 작아."],["This shirt is too small.","Let's buy a new one.","이 셔츠 너무 작아. / 새로 하나 사자."]],"short":[["Is your hair long?","No, it is short.","머리 길어? / 아니, 짧아."],["My pencil is short.","You can use mine.","내 연필이 짧아. / 내 거 써도 돼."]],"long":[["A snake is long.","And it has no legs!","뱀은 길어. / 그리고 다리가 없어!"],["Is the movie long?","Yes, two hours!","영화 길어? / 응, 두 시간이야!"]],"fat":[["Look at that cat!","It is so fat.","저 고양이 좀 봐! / 정말 뚱뚱하다."],["Is your dog fat?","Yes, he eats a lot.","너희 개 뚱뚱해? / 응, 많이 먹어."]],"thin":[["Is this book thick?","No, it is thin.","이 책 두꺼워? / 아니, 얇아."],["The ice is thin.","Don't walk on it!","얼음이 얇아. / 그 위로 걷지 마!"]],"good":[["How was the test?","It was good!","시험 어땠어? / 잘 봤어!"],["This soup is very good.","Thank you! I made it.","이 수프 정말 맛있다. / 고마워! 내가 만들었어."]],"bad":[["How is the weather?","It's bad. It's raining.","날씨 어때? / 나빠. 비가 와."],["I had a bad dream.","Come here. It's okay.","나쁜 꿈을 꿨어. / 이리 와. 괜찮아."]],"book":[["What are you reading?","A book about dogs.","뭐 읽어? / 강아지에 대한 책이야."],["Can I borrow your book?","Sure, here you are.","네 책 빌려도 돼? / 물론, 여기 있어."]],"glue":[["How do I stick this paper?","Use some glue.","이 종이 어떻게 붙여? / 풀을 좀 써."],["Do you have glue?","Yes, it's in my bag.","풀 있어? / 응, 내 가방 안에 있어."]],"bell":[["What's that sound?","It's the school bell.","저게 무슨 소리야? / 학교 종소리야."],["Ring the bell, please.","Ding dong!","종을 울려 주세요. / 딩동!"]],"friend":[["Who is that girl?","She is my friend.","저 여자애는 누구야? / 내 친구야."],["Do you want to be my friend?","Yes, of course!","나랑 친구 할래? / 응, 물론이지!"]],"chair":[["Where can I sit?","Sit on this chair.","어디 앉아도 돼? / 이 의자에 앉아."],["The chair is broken.","Don't sit on it.","의자가 부서졌어. / 앉지 마."]],"window":[["It's hot in here.","Let's open the window.","여기 더워. / 창문 열자."],["What do you see?","A bird at the window!","뭐가 보여? / 창문에 새가 있어!"]],"bag":[["Where is my pencil?","It's in your bag.","내 연필 어디 있지? / 네 가방 안에 있어."],["Your bag is so heavy!","It has many books.","가방이 정말 무겁다! / 책이 많아."]],"morning":[["When do you walk your dog?","Every morning.","강아지 산책은 언제 시켜? / 매일 아침."],["When do you eat breakfast?","In the morning.","아침밥은 언제 먹어? / 아침에."]],"ruler":[["How long is this line?","Let's use a ruler.","이 선은 얼마나 길어? / 자를 써 보자."],["Can I borrow your ruler?","Here you are.","자 빌려도 돼? / 여기 있어."]],"board":[["Where is the answer?","It's on the board.","정답이 어디 있어? / 칠판에 있어."],["Please write your name on the board.","Okay, teacher.","칠판에 이름을 써 주세요. / 네, 선생님."]],"teacher":[["Who is that lady?","She is my teacher.","저분은 누구야? / 우리 선생님이야."],["I have a question.","Ask the teacher.","질문이 있어. / 선생님께 여쭤봐."]],"name":[["Hi! What is your name?","I'm Mina. Nice to meet you!","안녕! 이름이 뭐야? / 나는 미나야. 만나서 반가워!"],["Write your name here.","Okay!","여기에 이름을 써. / 알았어!"]],"test":[["Are you ready?","Yes, I studied for the test.","준비됐어? / 응, 시험 공부했어."],["How was the test?","It was easy!","시험 어땠어? / 쉬웠어!"]],"eraser":[["I made a mistake.","Use my eraser.","틀렸어. / 내 지우개 써."],["Where is my eraser?","It's under the desk.","내 지우개 어디 있지? / 책상 아래에 있어."]],"study":[["What are you doing?","I study English.","뭐 하고 있어? / 영어 공부해."],["Let's study together.","Good idea!","같이 공부하자. / 좋은 생각이야!"]],"crayon":[["What color is your crayon?","It's red.","네 크레용은 무슨 색이야? / 빨간색이야."],["Can I use your crayon?","Sure, which color?","네 크레용 써도 돼? / 물론, 무슨 색?"]],"pencil":[["I need a pencil.","Here, take mine.","연필이 필요해. / 여기, 내 거 가져."],["Is this your pencil?","Yes, thank you!","이거 네 연필이야? / 응, 고마워!"]],"desk":[["Where is your book?","It's on my desk.","네 책 어디 있어? / 내 책상 위에 있어."],["Clean your desk, please.","Okay, teacher.","책상을 정리하세요. / 네, 선생님."]],"class":[["What is next?","Music class!","다음은 뭐야? / 음악 수업!"],["Don't be late for class.","I won't!","수업에 늦지 마. / 안 늦을게!"]],"clock":[["What time is it?","Look at the clock.","몇 시야? / 시계를 봐."],["The clock is ticking.","Tick, tock!","시계가 째깍거려. / 째깍, 째깍!"]],"tennis":[["What sport do you play?","I play tennis.","무슨 운동 해? / 테니스 쳐."],["Do you have a tennis ball?","Yes, here!","테니스공 있어? / 응, 여기!"]],"ball":[["Throw me the ball!","Catch!","공 던져 줘! / 받아!"],["Where is my ball?","It's under the car.","내 공 어디 있지? / 차 밑에 있어."]],"golf":[["What does your grandpa play?","He plays golf.","할아버지는 무슨 운동 하셔? / 골프 치셔."],["Is golf hard?","Yes, the ball is small.","골프 어려워? / 응, 공이 작아."]],"go":[["Where are you now?","I go to the park.","지금 어디야? / 공원에 가."],["Let's go home.","Okay!","집에 가자. / 그래!"]],"boxing":[["What is that sport?","It's boxing.","저 운동은 뭐야? / 권투야."],["Do you like boxing?","No, I like soccer.","권투 좋아해? / 아니, 축구 좋아해."]],"swim":[["Can you swim?","Yes, I can.","수영할 수 있어? / 응, 할 수 있어."],["Let's swim in the pool!","Wait, put on your cap.","수영장에서 수영하자! / 잠깐, 모자 써."]],"bike":[["How do you go to school?","I ride my bike.","학교에 어떻게 가? / 자전거 타고 가."],["Is that your new bike?","Yes, it's blue!","그거 네 새 자전거야? / 응, 파란색이야!"]],"stop":[["The light is red.","Stop, please!","신호등이 빨간불이야. / 멈춰 주세요!"],["Stop running in the hall.","Sorry, teacher.","복도에서 뛰지 마. / 죄송해요, 선생님."]],"baseball":[["What's your favorite sport?","I like baseball.","제일 좋아하는 운동이 뭐야? / 야구 좋아해."],["Do you have a baseball cap?","Yes, it's red.","야구 모자 있어? / 응, 빨간색이야."]],"ski":[["What do you do in winter?","I ski with my dad.","겨울에 뭐 해? / 아빠랑 스키 타."],["Can you ski?","Yes, a little.","스키 탈 수 있어? / 응, 조금."]],"helmet":[["Put on your helmet.","Okay, I'm ready to ride.","헬멧 써. / 응, 탈 준비 됐어."],["Why do you wear a helmet?","It keeps my head safe.","왜 헬멧을 써? / 머리를 안전하게 지켜 줘."]],"win":[["Did your team win?","Yes, we won!","너희 팀 이겼어? / 응, 이겼어!"],["I want to win the race.","Run fast!","경주에서 이기고 싶어. / 빨리 달려!"]],"exercise":[["Do you exercise every day?","Yes, I run in the morning.","매일 운동해? / 응, 아침에 달려."],["Exercise is good for you.","I know!","운동은 너에게 좋아. / 알아!"]],"bat":[["Hit the ball with the bat!","Here I go!","방망이로 공을 쳐! / 간다!"],["Is this yours?","Yes, it's my bat.","이거 네 거야? / 응, 내 방망이야."]],"soccer":[["Let's play soccer!","Kick the ball to me!","축구 하자! / 공을 나한테 차!"],["Do you like soccer?","Yes, it's fun!","축구 좋아해? / 응, 재미있어!"]],"rule":[["Can I run here?","No, that's the rule.","여기서 뛰어도 돼? / 아니, 그게 규칙이야."],["What is the first rule?","Be nice to friends.","첫 번째 규칙이 뭐야? / 친구에게 잘해 주기."]],"basketball":[["Look at that tall boy!","He plays basketball.","저 키 큰 남자아이 봐! / 농구를 해."],["Where is the basketball?","It's in the gym.","농구공 어디 있어? / 체육관에 있어."]],"skate":[["What do you do on ice?","I skate!","얼음 위에서 뭐 해? / 스케이트 타!"],["Can you skate?","Yes, very well!","스케이트 탈 수 있어? / 응, 아주 잘!"]],"glove":[["My hand is cold.","Put on a glove.","손이 차가워. / 장갑을 껴."],["Where is my glove?","It's in your pocket.","내 장갑 어디 있지? / 네 주머니에 있어."]],"lose":[["Don't lose your key.","I will keep it in my bag.","열쇠 잃어버리지 마. / 가방에 넣어 둘게."],["Did we win?","No, we lose today.","우리 이겼어? / 아니, 오늘은 졌어."]],"clap":[["Did you like the song?","Yes! Let's clap!","노래 좋았어? / 응! 박수 치자!"],["The show is over!","Let's clap for them!","공연이 끝났어! / 박수 쳐 주자!"]],"sing":[["What do you like to do?","I like to sing.","뭐 하는 걸 좋아해? / 노래하는 걸 좋아해."],["Let's sing a song.","Happy birthday to you!","노래 부르자. / 생일 축하합니다!"]],"dance":[["The music is fun!","Let's dance!","음악이 신난다! / 춤추자!"],["Can you dance?","Yes, look at me!","춤출 수 있어? / 응, 나 봐!"]],"walk":[["Do you take the bus?","No, I walk to school.","버스 타? / 아니, 학교에 걸어가."],["Let's walk the dog.","Okay, get the leash.","강아지 산책시키자. / 그래, 목줄 가져와."]],"run":[["We are late!","Run to the bus!","우리 늦었어! / 버스까지 뛰어!"],["Can you run fast?","Yes, very fast!","빨리 달릴 수 있어? / 응, 아주 빨리!"]],"jump":[["Can a frog jump high?","Yes, very high!","개구리는 높이 뛸 수 있어? / 응, 아주 높이!"],["Let's jump rope.","One, two, three!","줄넘기하자. / 하나, 둘, 셋!"]],"eat":[["What's for lunch?","I eat rice and soup.","점심 뭐야? / 밥이랑 국 먹어."],["Can I eat this cookie?","Sure, go ahead.","이 쿠키 먹어도 돼? / 물론, 먹어."]],"drink":[["I'm thirsty.","Drink some water.","목말라. / 물 좀 마셔."],["What do you have in the morning?","I drink milk.","아침에 뭐 먹어? / 우유 마셔."]],"stand":[["Please stand up.","Yes, teacher.","일어서 주세요. / 네, 선생님."],["Where do I go?","Stand in line, please.","어디로 가요? / 줄을 서 주세요."]],"sit":[["Is this chair free?","Yes, sit down.","이 의자 비었어? / 응, 앉아."],["Where is the cat?","It likes to sit on the sofa.","고양이 어디 있어? / 소파에 앉는 걸 좋아해."]],"write":[["What are you doing?","I write a letter.","뭐 해? / 편지를 써."],["Can you write your name?","Yes, M-I-N-A!","네 이름 쓸 수 있어? / 응, M-I-N-A!"]],"read":[["Can you read this word?","Yes, it says \"cat\".","이 단어 읽을 수 있어? / 응, \"cat\"이라고 써 있어."],["What do you do at night?","I read a book.","밤에 뭐 해? / 책을 읽어."]],"cut":[["How do I make a star?","Cut the paper like this.","별은 어떻게 만들어? / 종이를 이렇게 잘라."],["Can you cut the cake?","Sure, here is a knife.","케이크 자를 수 있어? / 물론, 여기 칼이야."]],"sleep":[["I'm so tired.","Go to sleep early.","너무 피곤해. / 일찍 자."],["Where does your dog sleep?","It sleeps on my bed.","너희 개는 어디서 자? / 내 침대에서 자."]],"wake":[["It's seven o'clock!","Wake up, Tom!","일곱 시야! / 톰, 일어나!"],["When do you wake up?","At seven.","몇 시에 일어나? / 일곱 시에."]],"close":[["It's cold.","Please close the door.","추워. / 문 좀 닫아 줘."],["Close your eyes.","Is it a surprise?","눈 감아. / 깜짝 선물이야?"]],"open":[["Can you open the box?","Yes, let me try.","상자 열 수 있어? / 응, 해 볼게."],["Is the store open?","Yes, until nine.","가게 문 열었어? / 응, 아홉 시까지."]],"fly":[["Can a penguin fly?","No, it can't.","펭귄은 날 수 있어? / 아니, 못 해."],["Look at the birds!","They fly so high!","새들 좀 봐! / 정말 높이 난다!"]],"hit":[["Hit the ball hard!","Here it goes!","공을 세게 쳐! / 간다!"],["Don't hit your brother.","Sorry, Mom.","동생 때리지 마. / 죄송해요, 엄마."]],"kick":[["Kick the ball to me!","Okay, here!","공을 나한테 차! / 응, 여기!"],["Can you kick high?","Yes, look!","높이 찰 수 있어? / 응, 봐!"]],"store":[["Where are you going?","To the store for milk.","어디 가? / 우유 사러 가게에."],["Is the store far?","No, it's next to the bank.","가게 멀어? / 아니, 은행 옆이야."]],"road":[["Is it safe to play here?","No, this is a road.","여기서 놀아도 안전해? / 아니, 여기는 길이야."],["Look both ways before you cross the road.","Okay, Dad.","길을 건너기 전에 양쪽을 봐. / 네, 아빠."]],"map":[["Where is the zoo?","Let's look at the map.","동물원이 어디야? / 지도를 보자."],["Can you read a map?","Yes, a little.","지도 볼 줄 알아? / 응, 조금."]],"left":[["Where is the bank?","Turn left here.","은행이 어디야? / 여기서 왼쪽으로 돌아."],["Which hand do you write with?","My left hand.","어느 손으로 써? / 왼손으로."]],"bakery":[["Where can I buy bread?","At the bakery.","빵은 어디서 사? / 빵집에서."],["The bakery smells so good!","Let's buy a cake.","빵집 냄새 정말 좋다! / 케이크 사자."]],"car":[["How do you go to the zoo?","By car.","동물원에 어떻게 가? / 차로."],["Is that your dad's car?","Yes, the blue one.","저거 너희 아빠 차야? / 응, 파란 거."]],"cross":[["Can we cross now?","Wait for the green light.","지금 건너도 돼? / 초록불을 기다려."],["Hold my hand when we cross the street.","Okay, Mom.","길 건널 때 내 손 잡아. / 네, 엄마."]],"turn":[["Where is the school?","Turn right at the corner.","학교가 어디야? / 모퉁이에서 오른쪽으로 돌아."],["Who goes next?","It's my turn!","다음은 누구야? / 내 차례야!"]],"church":[["Where do you go on Sunday?","I go to church.","일요일에 어디 가? / 교회에 가."],["What is that tall building?","It's a church.","저 높은 건물은 뭐야? / 교회야."]],"bus":[["How do you go to school?","By bus.","학교에 어떻게 가? / 버스로."],["Here comes the bus!","Let's get on.","버스 온다! / 타자."]],"on":[["Where is my cat?","It's on the bed.","내 고양이 어디 있지? / 침대 위에 있어."],["Where is the cup?","It's on the table.","컵 어디 있어? / 탁자 위에 있어."]],"right":[["Which way is the park?","Turn right.","공원은 어느 쪽이야? / 오른쪽으로 돌아."],["Is this the right answer?","Yes, good job!","이게 맞는 답이야? / 응, 잘했어!"]],"bank":[["Where is Dad going?","He is going to the bank.","아빠 어디 가셔? / 은행에 가셔."],["Is the bank open?","No, it's closed today.","은행 열었어? / 아니, 오늘은 닫았어."]],"plane":[["How do you go to Jeju?","By plane.","제주도에 어떻게 가? / 비행기로."],["Look up! A plane!","It's so big!","위를 봐! 비행기야! / 정말 크다!"]],"under":[["Where is the ball?","It's under the chair.","공 어디 있어? / 의자 아래에 있어."],["Where does the cat sleep?","Under the table.","고양이는 어디서 자? / 탁자 아래에서."]],"front":[["Where is the bus stop?","In front of the school.","버스 정류장이 어디야? / 학교 앞에."],["Can I sit in the front?","Sure, sit here.","앞에 앉아도 돼? / 물론, 여기 앉아."]],"school":[["Where are you going?","I'm going to school.","어디 가? / 학교에 가."],["Do you like your school?","Yes, I love it!","학교 좋아? / 응, 정말 좋아!"]],"city":[["Do you live in the country?","No, I live in the city.","시골에 살아? / 아니, 도시에 살아."],["Seoul is a big city.","It has many tall buildings.","서울은 큰 도시야. / 높은 건물이 많아."]],"in":[["Where is my pencil?","It's in your bag.","내 연필 어디 있지? / 네 가방 안에 있어."],["Where is the fish?","It's in the water.","물고기 어디 있어? / 물속에 있어."]],"apple":[["What fruit is red and round?","An apple!","빨갛고 둥근 과일은? / 사과!"],["Is that an apple?","Yes, a red one.","저거 사과야? / 응, 빨간 거."]],"grape":[["What color is a grape?","It is purple.","포도는 무슨 색이야? / 보라색이야."],["Do you want grape juice?","Yes, please!","포도 주스 마실래? / 응, 주세요!"]],"fruit":[["What fruit do you like?","I like bananas.","무슨 과일 좋아해? / 바나나 좋아해."],["Eat some fruit.","Okay, I'll eat a peach.","과일 좀 먹어. / 응, 복숭아 먹을게."]],"egg":[["What do you want for breakfast?","An egg, please.","아침으로 뭐 먹을래? / 달걀 주세요."],["Where does an egg come from?","From a chicken!","달걀은 어디서 와? / 닭한테서!"]],"candy":[["Can I have a candy?","Just one, okay?","사탕 하나 먹어도 돼? / 딱 하나만, 알았지?"],["Too much candy is bad.","It's bad for my teeth.","사탕을 너무 많이 먹으면 안 좋아. / 이에 안 좋지."]],"pear":[["What is this fruit?","It's a pear.","이 과일은 뭐야? / 배야."],["Is the pear sweet?","Yes, very sweet!","배 달아? / 응, 아주 달아!"]],"peach":[["What fruit is pink and soft?","A peach!","분홍색이고 말랑한 과일은 뭐야? / 복숭아!"],["Do you like peach juice?","Yes, it's my favorite.","복숭아 주스 좋아해? / 응, 제일 좋아해."]],"bread":[["What do you eat for breakfast?","I eat bread and milk.","아침에 뭐 먹어? / 빵이랑 우유 먹어."],["Where did you buy this bread?","At the bakery.","이 빵 어디서 샀어? / 빵집에서."]],"rice":[["What do you eat for dinner?","I eat rice and soup.","저녁에 뭐 먹어? / 밥이랑 국 먹어."],["Do you want more rice?","Yes, please.","밥 더 먹을래? / 네, 주세요."]],"water":[["I'm thirsty.","Here is some water.","목말라. / 여기 물 있어."],["Do fish live in water?","Yes, they do.","물고기는 물에 살아? / 응, 그래."]],"banana":[["What do monkeys eat?","They eat a banana!","원숭이는 뭐 먹어? / 바나나를 먹어!"],["What color is a banana?","It's yellow.","바나나는 무슨 색이야? / 노란색이야."]],"soup":[["Is the soup hot?","Yes, be careful.","수프 뜨거워? / 응, 조심해."],["What's for lunch?","Chicken soup!","점심 뭐야? / 닭고기 수프!"]],"meat":[["Do you eat meat?","Yes, I like chicken.","고기 먹어? / 응, 닭고기 좋아해."],["Lions eat meat.","Do they eat grass?","사자는 고기를 먹어. / 풀도 먹어?"]],"milk":[["What do you drink in the morning?","A glass of milk.","아침에 뭐 마셔? / 우유 한 잔."],["Does the cat want milk?","Yes, it does.","고양이가 우유 마시고 싶어 해? / 응, 그래."]],"juice":[["What do you want to drink?","Orange juice, please.","뭐 마실래? / 오렌지 주스 주세요."],["Is the juice cold?","Yes, it's in the fridge.","주스 차가워? / 응, 냉장고에 있었어."]],"hamburger":[["What do you want for lunch?","A hamburger, please!","점심으로 뭐 먹을래? / 햄버거 주세요!"],["Is this hamburger big?","Yes, very big!","이 햄버거 커? / 응, 아주 커!"]],"sandwich":[["What is in your lunch box?","A sandwich and an apple.","도시락에 뭐 있어? / 샌드위치랑 사과."],["Can you make a sandwich?","Sure, with cheese!","샌드위치 만들 수 있어? / 물론, 치즈 넣어서!"]],"cake":[["Happy birthday, Mina!","Thank you! Let's eat the cake.","생일 축하해, 미나! / 고마워! 케이크 먹자."],["Who made this cake?","My dad made it.","이 케이크 누가 만들었어? / 아빠가 만들었어."]],"cheese":[["What do mice like?","They like cheese!","쥐는 뭘 좋아해? / 치즈를 좋아해!"],["Smile for the photo!","Say cheese!","사진 찍게 웃어! / 치즈 하세요!"]],"snack":[["I'm a little hungry.","Let's have a snack.","조금 배고파. / 간식 먹자."],["What is your favorite snack?","Cookies!","제일 좋아하는 간식이 뭐야? / 쿠키!"]],"make":[["What are you doing?","I make a paper plane.","뭐 해? / 종이비행기를 만들어."],["Can you make a cake?","Yes, with my mom.","케이크 만들 수 있어? / 응, 엄마랑."]],"buy":[["What do you want at the store?","I want to buy a toy.","가게에서 뭐 갖고 싶어? / 장난감을 사고 싶어."],["Where can I buy milk?","At the store.","우유는 어디서 사? / 가게에서."]],"help":[["This box is heavy.","Let me help you.","이 상자 무거워. / 내가 도와줄게."],["Can you help me?","Sure, what is it?","나 좀 도와줄래? / 물론, 뭔데?"]],"draw":[["What do you like to do?","I like to draw.","뭐 하는 걸 좋아해? / 그림 그리는 걸 좋아해."],["Can you draw a cat?","Yes, look!","고양이 그릴 수 있어? / 응, 봐!"]],"travel":[["Where do you want to travel?","I want to go to Jeju.","어디로 여행 가고 싶어? / 제주도에 가고 싶어."],["Do you like to travel?","Yes, I love trips!","여행하는 거 좋아해? / 응, 여행 정말 좋아!"]],"ride":[["Can you ride a bike?","Yes, I can.","자전거 탈 수 있어? / 응, 탈 수 있어."],["Let's ride the bus.","Okay, here it comes.","버스 타자. / 그래, 저기 온다."]],"use":[["Can I use your pencil?","Sure, here.","네 연필 써도 돼? / 물론, 여기."],["How do I use this?","Push the red button.","이거 어떻게 써? / 빨간 버튼을 눌러."]],"give":[["It's Mom's birthday.","I will give her a flower.","엄마 생신이야. / 꽃을 드릴 거야."],["Can you give me some water?","Here you are.","물 좀 줄래? / 여기 있어."]],"play":[["Let's play outside!","Okay, let's go!","밖에서 놀자! / 그래, 가자!"],["Do you play the piano?","Yes, every day.","피아노 쳐? / 응, 매일."]],"letter":[["What is this?","It's a letter from Grandma.","이게 뭐야? / 할머니가 보낸 편지야."],["What is the first letter of \"cat\"?","It's C!","\"cat\"의 첫 글자가 뭐야? / C야!"]],"movie":[["What do you want to do?","Let's watch a movie.","뭐 하고 싶어? / 영화 보자."],["Was the movie fun?","Yes, very funny!","영화 재미있었어? / 응, 정말 웃겼어!"]],"camp":[["Where are you going this summer?","I'm going to camp.","이번 여름에 어디 가? / 캠프에 가."],["Was the camp fun?","Yes, we made a fire!","캠프 재미있었어? / 응, 불도 피웠어!"]],"gift":[["This is for you.","Wow, a gift! Thank you!","이거 너 줄 거야. / 와, 선물이네! 고마워!"],["What is in the gift box?","A teddy bear!","선물 상자에 뭐가 있어? / 곰 인형!"]],"plan":[["What is your plan for Sunday?","I will visit Grandma.","일요일 계획이 뭐야? / 할머니 댁에 갈 거야."],["Do you have a plan?","Yes, let's go to the zoo!","계획 있어? / 응, 동물원에 가자!"]],"favorite":[["Do you like blue?","Yes, it's my favorite color.","파란색 좋아해? / 응, 내가 제일 좋아하는 색이야."],["Which animal do you like most?","My favorite is the panda.","어느 동물이 제일 좋아? / 판다가 제일 좋아."]],"picture":[["Look at this picture!","Wow, you drew it?","이 그림 봐! / 와, 네가 그렸어?"],["Let's take a picture.","Smile!","사진 찍자. / 웃어!"]],"party":[["Are you coming to my party?","Yes, I will!","내 파티에 올 거야? / 응, 갈게!"],["Why is everyone here?","It's my birthday party.","왜 다들 여기 있어? / 내 생일 파티야."]],"try":[["This food is new.","Just try it!","이 음식은 처음이야. / 한번 먹어 봐!"],["I can't do it.","Try again. You can do it!","못 하겠어. / 다시 해 봐. 넌 할 수 있어!"]],"plant":[["What is in the pot?","It's a small plant.","화분에 뭐가 있어? / 작은 식물이야."],["Let's plant a tree.","I will get water!","나무를 심자. / 내가 물 가져올게!"]],"cat":[["What is your pet?","I have a cat.","반려동물이 뭐야? / 고양이를 키워."],["Meow! What is that?","It's a little cat.","야옹! 저게 뭐야? / 작은 고양이야."]],"dog":[["Woof! Woof!","That's my dog.","멍! 멍! / 그건 우리 개야."],["Do you have a pet?","Yes, a big dog.","반려동물 있어? / 응, 큰 개."]],"cow":[["What gives us milk?","A cow gives us milk.","우리한테 우유를 주는 건 뭐야? / 소가 우유를 줘."],["Moo! Moo!","Look, a cow!","음메! 음메! / 봐, 소야!"]],"sheep":[["What animal says \"baa\"?","A sheep!","\"매애\" 하고 우는 동물은? / 양!"],["Is the sheep soft?","Yes, very soft.","양은 부드러워? / 응, 아주 부드러워."]],"horse":[["Can I ride the horse?","Yes, hold on tight.","말 타도 돼? / 응, 꽉 잡아."],["What animal runs fast on a farm?","A horse!","농장에서 빨리 달리는 동물은? / 말!"]],"pig":[["Oink! Oink!","It's a pink pig!","꿀! 꿀! / 분홍 돼지야!"],["Is the pig dirty?","Yes, it likes mud.","돼지는 더러워? / 응, 진흙을 좋아해."]],"fox":[["What animal has a big tail?","A fox!","꼬리가 큰 동물은? / 여우!"],["Is the fox red?","Yes, red and white.","여우는 빨개? / 응, 빨갛고 하얘."]],"duck":[["Quack! Quack!","Look, a duck in the pond.","꽥! 꽥! / 봐, 연못에 오리가 있어."],["Can a duck swim?","Yes, very well!","오리는 수영할 수 있어? / 응, 아주 잘해!"]],"lion":[["Who is the king of animals?","The lion!","동물의 왕은 누구야? / 사자!"],["Roar! What is that?","It's a lion.","어흥! 저게 뭐야? / 사자야."]],"fish":[["What lives in the sea?","A fish!","바다에는 뭐가 살아? / 물고기!"],["What does your cat eat?","It eats fish.","너희 고양이는 뭐 먹어? / 생선 먹어."]],"deer":[["What animal has big horns?","A deer!","큰 뿔이 있는 동물은? / 사슴!"],["Look! Something is in the forest.","It's a baby deer.","봐! 숲에 뭔가 있어. / 아기 사슴이야."]],"bear":[["What animal likes honey?","A bear!","꿀을 좋아하는 동물은? / 곰!"],["Is that a big bear?","Yes, a brown one.","저거 큰 곰이야? / 응, 갈색 곰."]],"tiger":[["What animal has stripes?","A tiger!","줄무늬가 있는 동물은? / 호랑이!"],["Is the tiger scary?","Yes, it's very strong.","호랑이 무서워? / 응, 아주 힘이 세."]],"hippo":[["What animal has a big mouth?","A hippo!","입이 큰 동물은? / 하마!"],["Where does the hippo live?","In the river.","하마는 어디 살아? / 강에 살아."]],"ant":[["What is that small bug?","It's an ant.","저 작은 벌레는 뭐야? / 개미야."],["Look at the ant!","It carries food.","개미 봐! / 먹이를 나르고 있어."]],"monkey":[["Who is eating a banana?","The monkey is!","누가 바나나를 먹고 있어? / 원숭이가!"],["Can a monkey climb trees?","Yes, very well.","원숭이는 나무를 탈 수 있어? / 응, 아주 잘."]],"zebra":[["What animal is black and white?","A zebra!","검정과 흰색인 동물은? / 얼룩말!"],["Is a zebra like a horse?","Yes, with stripes!","얼룩말은 말이랑 비슷해? / 응, 줄무늬가 있어!"]],"snake":[["What animal has no legs?","A snake!","다리가 없는 동물은? / 뱀!"],["Hiss! What's that?","It's a snake. Be careful!","쉬익! 저게 뭐야? / 뱀이야. 조심해!"]],"frog":[["What animal says \"ribbit\"?","A frog!","\"개굴\" 하는 동물은? / 개구리!"],["Where does the frog live?","In the pond.","개구리는 어디 살아? / 연못에."]],"bird":[["What is in the tree?","A little bird.","나무에 뭐가 있어? / 작은 새."],["Can a bird fly?","Yes, it can.","새는 날 수 있어? / 응, 날 수 있어."]],"day":[["How was your day?","It was great!","오늘 하루 어땠어? / 아주 좋았어!"],["What day is it today?","It's Monday.","오늘 무슨 요일이야? / 월요일이야."]],"night":[["When do owls wake up?","At night.","부엉이는 언제 깨? / 밤에."],["Good night, Mom.","Sleep well.","안녕히 주무세요, 엄마. / 잘 자."]],"snowy":[["How is the weather?","It's snowy and cold.","날씨 어때? / 눈이 오고 추워."],["Let's make a snowman!","Yes, it's a snowy day!","눈사람 만들자! / 응, 눈 오는 날이야!"]],"windy":[["Why is your hair messy?","It's windy outside.","머리가 왜 헝클어졌어? / 밖에 바람이 불어."],["Let's fly a kite!","Good idea, it's windy.","연 날리자! / 좋아, 바람이 불어."]],"hot":[["It's so hot today.","Let's go swimming.","오늘 너무 더워. / 수영하러 가자."],["Is the soup hot?","Yes, blow on it.","수프 뜨거워? / 응, 후후 불어."]],"cold":[["It's cold outside.","Wear your coat.","밖이 추워. / 외투 입어."],["Do you want cold water?","Yes, please.","찬물 마실래? / 응, 주세요."]],"cloudy":[["Is it sunny?","No, it's cloudy.","해가 났어? / 아니, 흐려."],["Will it rain?","Maybe. It's cloudy.","비 올까? / 아마도. 흐려."]],"rainy":[["How is the weather?","It's rainy.","날씨 어때? / 비가 와."],["Take your umbrella.","Oh, it's a rainy day.","우산 가져가. / 아, 비 오는 날이구나."]],"dry":[["Is your shirt wet?","No, it's dry now.","셔츠 젖었어? / 아니, 이제 말랐어."],["My mouth is dry.","Drink some water.","입이 말라. / 물 좀 마셔."]],"wet":[["Why are you wet?","It's raining outside.","왜 젖었어? / 밖에 비가 와."],["Is the floor wet?","Yes, don't run!","바닥 젖었어? / 응, 뛰지 마!"]],"hat":[["It's sunny today.","Wear your hat.","오늘 햇볕이 강해. / 모자 써."],["Is this your hat?","Yes, the red one.","이거 네 모자야? / 응, 빨간 거."]],"tie":[["Can you tie your shoes?","Yes, I can.","신발 끈 묶을 수 있어? / 응, 할 수 있어."],["Let's tie the ribbon.","Make a big bow!","리본을 묶자. / 큰 나비 모양으로!"]],"skirt":[["What are you wearing?","A pink skirt.","뭐 입었어? / 분홍 치마."],["Is that a new skirt?","Yes, Mom bought it.","그거 새 치마야? / 응, 엄마가 사 주셨어."]],"coat":[["It's cold outside.","Put on your coat.","밖이 추워. / 외투 입어."],["Where is my coat?","It's on the chair.","내 외투 어디 있지? / 의자 위에 있어."]],"dress":[["You look pretty!","Thank you, it's a new dress.","너 예쁘다! / 고마워, 새 원피스야."],["What will you wear to the party?","My yellow dress.","파티에 뭐 입을 거야? / 노란 원피스."]],"shirt":[["Your shirt is dirty.","I will wash it.","셔츠가 더러워. / 빨게."],["What color is your shirt?","It's white.","셔츠가 무슨 색이야? / 흰색이야."]],"pants":[["Are these your pants?","Yes, the blue ones.","이거 네 바지야? / 응, 파란 거."],["My pants are too short.","You are growing!","바지가 너무 짧아. / 너 크고 있구나!"]],"shoe":[["I can't find my shoe.","It's under the bed.","신발 한 짝을 못 찾겠어. / 침대 밑에 있어."],["Is this your shoe?","Yes, thank you!","이거 네 신발이야? / 응, 고마워!"]],"sock":[["My foot is cold.","Put on a sock.","발이 차가워. / 양말 신어."],["Where is my other sock?","The dog has it!","양말 한 짝 어디 있지? / 강아지가 가져갔어!"]],"scarf":[["It's cold and windy.","Wear a scarf.","춥고 바람이 불어. / 목도리 해."],["What a nice scarf!","My grandma made it.","목도리 멋지다! / 할머니가 만들어 주셨어."]],"mountain":[["Where are you going?","We are going up the mountain.","어디 가? / 산에 올라가."],["Is the mountain high?","Yes, very high!","산이 높아? / 응, 아주 높아!"]],"sky":[["What color is the sky?","It's blue.","하늘은 무슨 색이야? / 파란색이야."],["Look at the sky!","Wow, a rainbow!","하늘 좀 봐! / 와, 무지개다!"]],"river":[["Where are the ducks?","They swim in the river.","오리들 어디 있어? / 강에서 헤엄쳐."],["Can we swim in the river?","No, it's too deep.","강에서 수영해도 돼? / 아니, 너무 깊어."]],"tree":[["Where is the bird?","It's in the tree.","새 어디 있어? / 나무에 있어."],["Can you climb a tree?","Yes, I can!","나무에 올라갈 수 있어? / 응, 할 수 있어!"]],"sun":[["It's so bright!","The sun is out.","정말 밝다! / 해가 떴어."],["When does the sun go down?","In the evening.","해는 언제 져? / 저녁에."]],"rock":[["Don't sit on that rock.","Why? Is it wet?","그 바위에 앉지 마. / 왜? 젖었어?"],["What is under the rock?","A little crab!","바위 밑에 뭐가 있어? / 작은 게!"]],"beach":[["Where do you want to go?","Let's go to the beach!","어디 가고 싶어? / 해변에 가자!"],["What did you do at the beach?","I made a sandcastle.","해변에서 뭐 했어? / 모래성을 만들었어."]],"sand":[["What is in your shoe?","Sand from the beach!","신발에 뭐가 있어? / 해변 모래야!"],["Let's play with the sand.","I will make a castle.","모래 가지고 놀자. / 나는 성을 만들 거야."]],"island":[["What is Jeju?","It's a big island.","제주도는 뭐야? / 큰 섬이야."],["How do we go to the island?","By boat.","섬에 어떻게 가? / 배로."]],"grass":[["Can we sit here?","Yes, on the grass.","여기 앉아도 돼? / 응, 풀밭에."],["What do cows eat?","They eat grass.","소는 뭘 먹어? / 풀을 먹어."]],"hill":[["Let's run up the hill!","Wait for me!","언덕 위로 뛰어가자! / 기다려!"],["What is on the hill?","A small house.","언덕 위에 뭐가 있어? / 작은 집."]],"moon":[["What is in the night sky?","The moon and stars.","밤하늘에 뭐가 있어? / 달이랑 별."],["Look! The moon is round.","It's so bright!","봐! 달이 둥글어. / 정말 밝다!"]],"star":[["What is in the sky at night?","A star!","밤하늘에 뭐가 있어? / 별!"],["Can you draw a star?","Yes, five points!","별 그릴 수 있어? / 응, 꼭짓점 다섯 개!"]],"shell":[["What did you find at the beach?","A pretty shell.","해변에서 뭐 찾았어? / 예쁜 조개껍데기."],["Can I hear the sea in the shell?","Try it!","조개껍데기에서 바다 소리가 들려? / 해 봐!"]],"blow":[["Make a wish!","Now blow out the candles!","소원 빌어! / 이제 촛불을 불어!"],["How do I make a balloon big?","Blow into it.","풍선을 어떻게 크게 만들어? / 바람을 불어 넣어."]],"air":[["Why do we need trees?","They make clean air.","나무는 왜 필요해? / 깨끗한 공기를 만들어."],["Open the window.","We need fresh air.","창문 열어. / 신선한 공기가 필요해."]],"fresh":[["Are these apples good?","Yes, they are fresh.","이 사과 괜찮아? / 응, 신선해."],["The air is fresh here!","We are on a mountain.","여기 공기가 상쾌해! / 우리가 산에 있잖아."]],"garden":[["Where is Grandma?","She is in the garden.","할머니 어디 계셔? / 정원에 계셔."],["What grows in your garden?","Flowers and tomatoes.","정원에 뭐가 자라? / 꽃이랑 토마토."]],"rest":[["I'm tired.","Let's rest a little.","피곤해. / 조금 쉬자."],["Take a rest, Dad.","Thank you, I will.","좀 쉬세요, 아빠. / 고마워, 그럴게."]],"hike":[["What do you do on weekends?","We hike in the mountains.","주말에 뭐 해? / 산에서 하이킹해."],["Is it hard to hike?","A little, but it's fun.","하이킹 힘들어? / 조금, 그래도 재미있어."]],"door":[["Someone is at the door.","I will open it.","누가 문 앞에 왔어. / 내가 열게."],["Please close the door.","Okay.","문 닫아 줘. / 알았어."]],"vase":[["Where do I put the flowers?","In the vase.","꽃을 어디에 둬? / 꽃병에."],["Oh no, the vase broke!","Be careful!","아이고, 꽃병이 깨졌어! / 조심해!"]],"bed":[["Where is the cat?","It's on my bed.","고양이 어디 있어? / 내 침대 위에."],["It's time for bed.","Good night!","잘 시간이야. / 잘 자!"]],"sofa":[["Where is Dad?","He is on the sofa.","아빠 어디 계셔? / 소파에 계셔."],["Is the sofa soft?","Yes, very soft!","소파 푹신해? / 응, 아주 푹신해!"]],"table":[["Where is my cup?","It's on the table.","내 컵 어디 있어? / 탁자 위에."],["Let's sit at the table.","Dinner is ready!","식탁에 앉자. / 저녁 준비됐어!"]],"lamp":[["It's dark in here.","Turn on the lamp.","여기 어두워. / 램프 켜."],["Where is the lamp?","Next to the bed.","램프 어디 있어? / 침대 옆에."]],"mirror":[["What are you looking at?","Myself in the mirror!","뭐 보고 있어? / 거울에 비친 나!"],["Is my hair okay?","Look in the mirror.","내 머리 괜찮아? / 거울 봐."]],"dish":[["Can you wash the dish?","Sure, Mom.","접시 좀 씻어 줄래? / 네, 엄마."],["Put the cake on the dish.","Okay.","케이크를 접시에 올려. / 알았어."]],"bowl":[["What do you need for soup?","A bowl and a spoon.","수프 먹으려면 뭐가 필요해? / 그릇이랑 숟가락."],["Put the rice in the bowl.","Okay!","밥을 그릇에 담아. / 알았어!"]],"cup":[["Do you want some milk?","Yes, one cup, please.","우유 마실래? / 응, 한 컵만 줘."],["Is this your cup?","Yes, the blue one.","이거 네 컵이야? / 응, 파란 거."]],"pot":[["What is in the pot?","Hot soup.","냄비에 뭐가 있어? / 뜨거운 국."],["Don't touch the pot!","Is it hot?","냄비 만지지 마! / 뜨거워?"]],"pan":[["How do you cook an egg?","In a pan.","달걀은 어떻게 요리해? / 프라이팬에."],["The pan is hot.","I won't touch it.","프라이팬이 뜨거워. / 안 만질게."]],"stove":[["Where is Mom cooking?","At the stove.","엄마는 어디서 요리하셔? / 가스레인지에서."],["Don't touch the stove.","Okay, it's hot.","가스레인지 만지지 마. / 응, 뜨겁지."]],"chess":[["What game do you play with Grandpa?","We play chess.","할아버지랑 무슨 게임 해? / 체스 해."],["Is chess hard?","Yes, but it's fun.","체스 어려워? / 응, 그래도 재미있어."]],"balloon":[["What do you want?","A red balloon!","뭐 갖고 싶어? / 빨간 풍선!"],["Pop! What was that?","My balloon broke!","펑! 저게 뭐야? / 내 풍선이 터졌어!"]],"kite":[["It's windy today.","Let's fly a kite!","오늘 바람이 불어. / 연 날리자!"],["Where is your kite?","It's in the tree!","네 연 어디 있어? / 나무에 걸렸어!"]],"block":[["What are you making?","A tower with a block.","뭐 만들어? / 블록으로 탑."],["Can I have one more block?","Here you are.","블록 하나 더 줄래? / 여기 있어."]],"yo-yo":[["What is that toy?","It's a yo-yo.","저 장난감은 뭐야? / 요요야."],["Can you play with a yo-yo?","Yes, up and down!","요요 할 줄 알아? / 응, 위로 아래로!"]],"toy":[["What is your favorite toy?","My robot.","제일 좋아하는 장난감이 뭐야? / 내 로봇."],["Clean up your toy, please.","Okay, Mom.","장난감 치워. / 네, 엄마."]],"robot":[["What is that?","It's a robot. It can walk!","저게 뭐야? / 로봇이야. 걸을 수 있어!"],["Can your robot talk?","Yes, it says hello.","네 로봇 말할 수 있어? / 응, 안녕이라고 해."]],"red":[["What color is an apple?","It's red.","사과는 무슨 색이야? / 빨간색이야."],["Stop! The light is red.","Okay, I will wait.","멈춰! 빨간불이야. / 응, 기다릴게."]],"orange":[["What fruit do you want?","An orange, please!","무슨 과일 먹을래? / 오렌지 주세요!"],["Do you want orange juice?","Yes, please!","오렌지 주스 마실래? / 응, 주세요!"]],"yellow":[["What color is a banana?","It's yellow.","바나나는 무슨 색이야? / 노란색이야."],["I like your yellow hat.","Thank you!","네 노란 모자 예쁘다. / 고마워!"]],"green":[["What color is the grass?","It's green.","풀은 무슨 색이야? / 초록색이야."],["Can we cross now?","Yes, the light is green.","지금 건너도 돼? / 응, 초록불이야."]],"blue":[["What color is the sky?","It's blue.","하늘은 무슨 색이야? / 파란색이야."],["Which pen is yours?","The blue one.","어느 펜이 네 거야? / 파란 거."]],"light blue":[["What color is your bag?","It's light blue.","가방이 무슨 색이야? / 하늘색이야."],["Is the sky dark blue today?","No, it's light blue.","오늘 하늘이 진한 파란색이야? / 아니, 하늘색이야."]],"purple":[["What color is a grape?","It's purple.","포도는 무슨 색이야? / 보라색이야."],["Mix red and blue.","It makes purple!","빨강이랑 파랑을 섞어. / 보라색이 돼!"]],"pink":[["What color is a pig?","It's pink.","돼지는 무슨 색이야? / 분홍색이야."],["Do you like my pink shoes?","Yes, they are cute!","내 분홍 신발 좋아? / 응, 귀여워!"]],"brown":[["What color is a bear?","It's brown.","곰은 무슨 색이야? / 갈색이야."],["What color is chocolate?","It's brown.","초콜릿은 무슨 색이야? / 갈색이야."]],"black":[["What color is the night sky?","It's black.","밤하늘은 무슨 색이야? / 검은색이야."],["Is your cat white?","No, it's black.","너희 고양이 하얘? / 아니, 검은색이야."]],"white":[["What color is snow?","It's white.","눈은 무슨 색이야? / 하얀색이야."],["What color is milk?","It's white.","우유는 무슨 색이야? / 하얀색이야."]],"gray":[["What color is an elephant?","It's gray.","코끼리는 무슨 색이야? / 회색이야."],["The sky is gray.","Maybe it will rain.","하늘이 회색이야. / 비가 올지도 몰라."]],"heart":[["What shape is this?","It's a heart.","이건 무슨 모양이야? / 하트야."],["I love you with all my heart.","I love you too, Mom!","진심으로 사랑해. / 저도 사랑해요, 엄마!"]],"triangle":[["How many sides does it have?","Three. It's a triangle.","변이 몇 개야? / 세 개. 삼각형이야."],["What shape is the pizza slice?","It's a triangle!","피자 한 조각은 무슨 모양이야? / 삼각형!"]],"square":[["What shape has four same sides?","A square!","네 변이 똑같은 모양은? / 정사각형!"],["What shape is the window?","It's a square.","창문은 무슨 모양이야? / 정사각형이야."]],"rectangle":[["What shape is the door?","It's a rectangle.","문은 무슨 모양이야? / 직사각형이야."],["What shape is the book?","A rectangle.","책은 무슨 모양이야? / 직사각형."]],"circle":[["What shape is the sun?","It's a circle.","해는 무슨 모양이야? / 동그라미야."],["Let's stand in a circle.","Hold hands!","동그랗게 서자. / 손잡아!"]],"ring":[["What is on your finger?","A gold ring.","손가락에 뭐가 있어? / 금반지."],["The phone will ring soon.","I will answer it.","곧 전화가 울릴 거야. / 내가 받을게."]],"one":[["How many noses do you have?","I have one nose.","코가 몇 개야? / 코는 한 개야."],["Can I have a cookie?","Just one.","쿠키 먹어도 돼? / 하나만."]],"two":[["How many eyes do you have?","I have two eyes.","눈이 몇 개야? / 두 개야."],["How many apples?","Two apples, please.","사과 몇 개? / 두 개 주세요."]],"three":[["How old is your brother?","He is three.","동생 몇 살이야? / 세 살이야."],["How many pigs are there?","There are three pigs.","돼지가 몇 마리야? / 세 마리야."]],"four":[["How many legs does a cat have?","It has four legs.","고양이 다리는 몇 개야? / 네 개야."],["How many people are in your family?","There are four.","가족이 몇 명이야? / 네 명이야."]],"five":[["How many fingers on one hand?","Five fingers.","한 손에 손가락이 몇 개야? / 다섯 개."],["What time is it?","It's five o'clock.","몇 시야? / 다섯 시야."]],"six":[["How old is your sister?","She is six.","여동생 몇 살이야? / 여섯 살이야."],["How many eggs do you need?","I need six eggs.","달걀 몇 개 필요해? / 여섯 개 필요해."]],"seven":[["How many days in a week?","Seven days.","일주일은 며칠이야? / 7일."],["When do you wake up?","At seven.","몇 시에 일어나? / 일곱 시에."]],"eight":[["How many legs does a spider have?","It has eight legs.","거미 다리는 몇 개야? / 여덟 개야."],["How old are you?","I am eight.","몇 살이야? / 여덟 살이야."]],"nine":[["What comes after eight?","Nine!","8 다음은 뭐야? / 9!"],["When does school start?","At nine.","학교는 몇 시에 시작해? / 아홉 시에."]],"ten":[["What is five plus five?","It's ten!","5 더하기 5는? / 10이야!"],["How many fingers do you have?","I have ten.","손가락 몇 개 있어? / 열 개."]],"eleven":[["How many players are on a soccer team?","Eleven players.","축구팀 선수는 몇 명이야? / 열한 명."],["What is ten plus one?","It's eleven.","10 더하기 1은? / 11이야."]],"twelve":[["How many months in a year?","Twelve months.","1년은 몇 달이야? / 열두 달."],["What time is lunch?","At twelve.","점심은 몇 시야? / 열두 시."]],"thirteen":[["How old is your cousin?","He is thirteen.","사촌 몇 살이야? / 열세 살이야."],["What is ten plus three?","It's thirteen.","10 더하기 3은? / 13이야."]],"fourteen":[["How many crayons do you have?","I have fourteen.","크레용 몇 개 있어? / 열네 개 있어."],["What is seven plus seven?","It's fourteen.","7 더하기 7은? / 14야."]],"fifteen":[["How many students are in your class?","There are fifteen.","반에 학생이 몇 명이야? / 열다섯 명이야."],["What is ten plus five?","It's fifteen.","10 더하기 5는? / 15야."]],"count":[["How many stars are there?","Let's count them!","별이 몇 개야? / 세어 보자!"],["Can you count to ten?","Yes! One, two, three…","열까지 셀 수 있어? / 응! 하나, 둘, 셋…"]],"birthday":[["Happy birthday!","Thank you!","생일 축하해! / 고마워!"],["When is your birthday?","It's in May.","생일이 언제야? / 5월이야."]],"time":[["What time is it?","It's three o'clock.","몇 시야? / 세 시야."],["It's time for lunch!","Yay, I'm hungry.","점심시간이야! / 야호, 배고파."]],"month":[["What is your favorite month?","December, for Christmas!","제일 좋아하는 달은? / 크리스마스가 있는 12월!"],["When is the trip?","Next month.","여행은 언제야? / 다음 달."]],"year":[["How old are you this year?","I'm eight.","올해 몇 살이야? / 여덟 살이야."],["When did you start school?","Last year.","학교는 언제 들어갔어? / 작년에."]]}